  <data name="MWH2_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Those kids of mine...[pause=0] They're sweet,[pause=10] but they're not the brightest.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MWH2_002" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>I wonder where they get it from?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MWH2_003" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>...Ooowwaaaa...[pause=0] Lower the drawbridge...</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MWH2_004" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>...Your king wishes to swim in his royal moat...[pause=0] Fwwwwaaaahhhhh....</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MWH3_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>It's got me worried about my own kids.[pause=0] They're quite prone to wandering themselves.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MWH3_002" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>I hope they won't go off somewhere where they would need rescuing...</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MWH3_003" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>They've wandered off plenty of times before and they always find their way back home safely.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MWH3_004" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Worse comes to worse,[pause=10] the guild could rescue them like they rescued {0},[pause=10] right?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MWH4_001" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Then I'll turn myself in for the bounty they're sure to put on me!</value>
  </data>
  <data name="MWH4_002" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Haha![pause=0] Dream castle,[pause=10] you will be mine!</value>
